                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Great old school side scrolling game, plays more like the older Mario games. Runs great on my system. Sometimes the jump is a bit iffy. The additions of the more checkpoints and the checkpoints saving crystal progress was a great addition. It made the crystal collecting objective more manageable. The time trials are still a bit on the tighter side for some levels. If you are a fast pace sidescroller kind of person I don't think this game will disappoint.",
